### STAFF MEDIA LIST
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/daily-reports/1/media
Accept: application/json
#(token de staff)
Authorization: Bearer (token de staff)

### STAFF UPLOAD MEDIA
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/daily-reports/1/media
#(token de staff)
Authorization: Bearer (token de staff)
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebKitFormBoundary

--WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_type"

image
--WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
--WebKitFormBoundary--

### STAFF DELETE MEDIA
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/daily-reports/1/media/1
Accept: application/json
#(token de staff)
Authorization: Bearer (token de staff)

