GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/daily-reports/1/media
Accept: application/json
#(token de client)
Authorization: Bearer (token de client)

### CREATE SERVICE
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/services
Content-Type: application/json
#(token de admin)
Authorization: Bearer (token de admin)

{
  "name": "Entrenamiento",
  "description": "Sesiones básicas de obediencia",
  "base_price": 35,
  "booking_mode": "time_slot",
  "duration_minutes": 60,
  "slot_interval_min": 60,
  "is_active": true
}

### UPDATE SERVICE
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/services/1
Content-Type: application/json
#(token de admin)
Authorization: Bearer (token de admin)

{
  "base_price": 25,
  "is_active": false
}
